{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "坐在总制作人的办公桌后  (Sitting Behind the Chief Producer's Desk)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the chief editor's office, Bu Xiaogu urgently invites Fentuan boss Ji Xiu over to commission an audience-data report, only for Ji Xiu to tease her for sitting at Chun Yuqiao's desk. Listen to their Mandarin chat first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天这么着急约您过来，是因为我们急需一份专业的数据报告。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要能切实反映网民民意，证明荣思伦确实适合出演倾城公主。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "话说，布总啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您别这么叫我，我就坐一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你都坐这桌子后边了，你特喜欢这张桌子吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "还有那个椅子，某人的气味已经沁到每一片木头里了呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秀姐，您说什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "别挣扎了，小布，跟我聊天最后不都会演变成这样吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我现在记起来了，我错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "说吧，到底怎么回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总他不理我了，是我惹他生气了，其实是我伤害他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你俩的关系，都发展到互相伤害了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天这么着急约您过来，是因为我们急需一份专业的数据报告。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I asked you over in such a hurry today because we urgently need a professional data report.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要能切实反映网民民意，证明荣思伦确实适合出演倾城公主。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It needs to reflect real online sentiment and prove Rong Silun truly suits Princess Qingcheng.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "话说，布总啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well now, look at Chief Bu!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您别这么叫我，我就坐一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please do not call me that; I am just sitting here for a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你都坐这桌子后边了，你特喜欢这张桌子吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are already sitting behind this desk—you really love this desk, do you not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "还有那个椅子，某人的气味已经沁到每一片木头里了呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And that chair too, where a certain someone's presence has soaked into every grain of wood.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秀姐，您说什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xiu, what on earth are you talking about?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "别挣扎了，小布，跟我聊天最后不都会演变成这样吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop struggling, Xiaobu; does every chat with me not end up turning into this anyway?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我现在记起来了，我错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now I remember—that was my mistake.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "说吧，到底怎么回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go ahead and tell me what happened.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总他不理我了，是我惹他生气了，其实是我伤害他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao is ignoring me; I made him angry, and in truth I was the one who hurt him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你俩的关系，都发展到互相伤害了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Has the relationship between you two already progressed to hurting each other?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天这么着急约您过来，是因为我们急需一份专业的数据报告。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要能切实反映网民民意，证明荣思伦确实适合出演倾城公主。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "话说，布总啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您别这么叫我，我就坐一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你都坐这桌子后边了，你特喜欢这张桌子吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "还有那个椅子，某人的气味已经沁到每一片木头里了呀。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秀姐，您说什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "别挣扎了，小布，跟我聊天最后不都会演变成这样吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我现在记起来了，我错了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "说吧，到底怎么回事？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总他不理我了，是我惹他生气了，其实是我伤害他了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你俩的关系，都发展到互相伤害了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Seeing right through Xiaogu's excuses, Ji Xiu gently prompts her to admit that she hurt Chun Yuqiao and fears he is ignoring her. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
